{"id":"b80ea50ccf56b0ca","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-cor-hopf-index.md","title":"Hopf Index Theorem","display":"cor-hopf-index — Hopf Index Theorem","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-hopf-index","aliases":["58-cor-hopf-index"],"display":"cor-hopf-index — Hopf Index Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-brouwer-degrees.md]]","[[58-df-compact-manifold]]","[[58-prop-euler-char]]","[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-polyhedron.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-hopf-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-hopf-index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-hopf-index — Hopf Index Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8a29fc853b841c25\" href=\"?note=8a29fc853b841c25\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md\">../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b61659960c0df8\" href=\"?note=11b61659960c0df8\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-brouwer-degrees.md\">../batch12/58-df-brouwer-degrees.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"871fa7428f3b8459\" href=\"?note=871fa7428f3b8459\" title=\"58-df-compact-manifold\">58-df-compact-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e7476d444d4ade0\" href=\"?note=5e7476d444d4ade0\" title=\"58-prop-euler-char\">58-prop-euler-char</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f9e7fe466acfa12\" href=\"?note=3f9e7fe466acfa12\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-chart.md\">../batch01/58-df-chart.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7941b5e851990dd5\" href=\"?note=7941b5e851990dd5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-polyhedron.md\">../batch18/58-df-polyhedron.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"efe8e2f202483a88\" href=\"?note=efe8e2f202483a88\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,v,Z,K,V_K,\\chi,\\tau_K,\\iota\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,v,Z,K,V_K,\\chi,\\tau_K,\\iota\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularValueBrouwerDegree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularValueBrouwerDegree}_S\\)</span> 使用原内部依赖的接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{S,p}\">\\(0_{S,p}\\)</span> 为指定切空间的零导子。局部坐标中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\Omega=\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)\">\\(\\overline\\Omega=\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoordinateRepresentative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(F,v,\\phi,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{CoordinateRepresentative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(F,v,\\phi,\\Omega)\\)</span> 保留四元接口，相对于固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}_{58}\\)</span> 来自书内坐标微分数据。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_p\">\\(\\Omega_p\\)</span> 的闭包只包含指定零点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的坐标像；原有正则值 Brouwer 次数约定保留，不擅自扩张为任意孤立退化零点的次数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoordinateRepresentative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(F,v,\\phi,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(v,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U,W\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,S)\n\\land\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)\\subseteq W\\land F\\in(\\mathbb R^n)^{\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)\\;\n\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}_{58}(F(x),v(\\phi^{-1}(x)),\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,S,\\phi^{-1}(x))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoordinateRepresentative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(F,v,\\phi,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(v,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U,W\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,S)\n\\land\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)\\subseteq W\\land F\\in(\\mathbb R^n)^{\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega)\\;\n\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}_{58}(F(x),v(\\phi^{-1}(x)),\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,S,\\phi^{-1}(x))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hopf-index} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(v,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land\nZ=\\{p\\in M:v(p)=0_{S,p}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(Z)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,Z,\\mathbb Z)\\land\n\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V_K,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(M,\\tau,K,V_K,\\tau_K)\\land\n\\forall p\\in Z\\;\\exists U_p,B_p,\\varphi_p,\\Omega_p,F_p\\in V\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;p\\in U_p\\land\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(\\langle U_p,B_p,\\varphi_p\\rangle,S)\\land\\varphi_p(p)=0\\land\n0\\in\\Omega_p\\land\\overline{\\Omega_p}\\subseteq B_p\\\\\n&amp;\\land Z\\cap\\varphi_p^{-1}[\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega_p)]=\\{p\\}\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(\\Omega_p,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{CoordinateRepresentative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(F_p,v,\\varphi_p,\\Omega_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RegularValueBrouwerDegree}_S(\\iota(p),F_p,\\Omega_p,0,n)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\sum_{p\\in Z}\\iota(p)=\\chi\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hopf-index} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(v,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land\nZ=\\{p\\in M:v(p)=0_{S,p}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(Z)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,Z,\\mathbb Z)\\land\n\\mathrm{EulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,K,V_K,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(M,\\tau,K,V_K,\\tau_K)\\land\n\\forall p\\in Z\\;\\exists U_p,B_p,\\varphi_p,\\Omega_p,F_p\\in V\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;p\\in U_p\\land\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(\\langle U_p,B_p,\\varphi_p\\rangle,S)\\land\\varphi_p(p)=0\\land\n0\\in\\Omega_p\\land\\overline{\\Omega_p}\\subseteq B_p\\\\\n&amp;\\land Z\\cap\\varphi_p^{-1}[\\operatorname{cl}_n(\\Omega_p)]=\\{p\\}\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(\\Omega_p,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{CoordinateRepresentative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(F_p,v,\\varphi_p,\\Omega_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RegularValueBrouwerDegree}_S(\\iota(p),F_p,\\Omega_p,0,n)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\sum_{p\\in Z}\\iota(p)=\\chi\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐坐标表示并明确切空间零元及局部隔离条件。原正则值次数接口保留；不把可能包含其他零点的区域次数当作单点局部指数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"8a29fc853b841c25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-brouwer-degrees.md","status":"resolved","id":"11b61659960c0df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-brouwer-degrees.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"871fa7428f3b8459","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-prop-euler-char","status":"resolved","id":"5e7476d444d4ade0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-prop-euler-char]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-chart.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f9e7fe466acfa12","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-polyhedron.md","status":"resolved","id":"7941b5e851990dd5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-polyhedron.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"efe8e2f202483a88","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,v,Z,K,V_K,\\chi,\\tau_K,\\iota\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>